  requiredFlags: []
  blockedFlags: []
  speaker: 3
  text: 'The gate closes behind her with a sound like a full stop.


    She came
    for six pieces of a person and left with a handful. The box is light. Light boxes
    are easy to run with; that is the trouble.


    Behind her the building opens
    its arms to the crews and gives up what it kept, and she will spend years half-remembering
    that there was something she meant to bring.


    The morning is very bright
    and there is almost nothing in her hands.'
  localizationKeys:
  - HOLLOW ESCAPE
  - The gate, the morning, the road. The box barely weighs anything at all.
